# Cleanup Unused Code Every Changeset

For every requested code changeset, perform cleanup in touched areas:

- Remove dead code made obsolete by the change.
- Delete unused imports, variables, functions, components, and files.
- Remove bypass-only compatibility paths UNLESS explicitly instructed to keep backward compatible.
- Keep cleanup scoped to the changed feature area; do not refactor unrelated code.

Before finishing, verify the changed files do not retain obvious unused artifacts.
